nisxiud/status/2120286524503937505"}, {"author_id": "1371286905891872771", "created_at": "2026-11-10T21:26:48.000Z", "edit_history_tweet_ids": ["2120266952258339147"], "id": "2120266952258339147", "in_reply_to_user_id": "2114635415424749568", "public_metrics": {"bookmark_count": 0, "impression_count": 1, "like_count": 0, "quote_count": 0, "reply_count": 0, "retweet_count": 0}, "referenced_tweets": [{"id": "2120147147312234737", "type": "replied_to"}], "text": "@RoadNaw9i @dotey @RoadNaw9i 偷懒还好办，一眼能看出来。更难的是它写得像那么回事，边界条件却全错。审查模型代码，最怕的不是明显的懒，是看起来很专业的错。", "url": "https://x.com/muzhifeng2/status/2120266952258339147"}, {"author_id": "221645274", "created_at": "2026-11-10T19:30:02.000Z", "edit_history_tweet_ids": ["2120237566981197869"], "id": "2120237566981197869", "in_reply_to_user_id": "3178231", "public_metrics": {"bookmark_count": 0, "impression_count": 155, "like_count": 1, "quote_count": 0, "reply_count": 0, "retweet_count": 0}, "referenced_tweets": [{"id": "2120064894376558646", "type": "replied_to"}], "text": "@dotey 是不是token燒太多了？兩個候選人解出一樣的題公司一定選token花的少的", "url": "https://x.com/KKyang9527/status/2120237566981197869"}, {"author_id": "2068767915285909504", "created_at": "2026-11-10T18:34:26.000Z", "edit_history_tweet_ids": ["2120223573797171345"], "id": "2120223573797171345", "in_reply_to_user_id": "3178231", "public_metrics": {"bookmark_count": 0, "impression_count": 0, "like_count": 0, "quote_count": 0, "reply_count": 0, "retweet_count": 0}, "referenced_tweets": [{"id": "2120064894376558646", "type": "replied_to"}], "text": "@dotey 这说得太对了，不考 LeetCode 并不等于更好过，AI Coding 面试更看你会不会带模型改真实仓库，而且发挥波动可能更大。那种 Django 代码库二面，准备方法都得换，不能再靠刷题刷出肌肉记忆。", "url": "https://x.com/bhhb8668/status/2120223573797171345"}, {"author_id": "1968871156108480512", "created_at": "2026-11-10T16:27:43.000Z", "edit_history_tweet_ids": ["2120191683942031419"], "id": "2120191683942031419", "in_reply_to_user_id": "3178231", "public_metrics": {"bookmark_count": 0, "impression_count": 86, "like_count": 0, "quote_count": 0, "reply_count": 0, "retweet_count": 0}, "referenced_tweets": [{"id": "2120064894376558646", "type": "replied_to"}], "text": "@dotey 以后面试是不是还得研究面试官喜欢哪种提示词啊（狗头", "url": "https://x.com/WEEXAILabs/status/2120191683942031419"}, {"author_id": "233361843", "created_at": "2026-11-10T16:26:27.000Z", "edit_history_tweet_ids": ["2120191364801450375"], "id": "2120191364801450375", "in_reply_to_user_id": "3178231", "public_metrics": {"bookmark_count": 0, "impression_count": 85, "like_count": 0, "quote_count": 0, "reply_count": 0, "retweet_count": 0}, "referenced_tweets": [{"id": "2120178330607522140", "type": "replied_to"}], "text": "@dotey 四个AI轮着用，最后被四个AI一起拒了", "url": "https://x.com/xbox_grok/status/2120191364801450375"}, {"author_id": "333154251", "created_at": "2026-11-10T16:23:08.000Z", "edit_history_tweet_ids": ["2120190533045985701"], "id": "2120190533045985701", "in_reply_to_user_id": "3178231", "public_metrics": {"bookmark_count": 0, "impression_count": 198, "like_count": 0, "quote_count": 0, "reply_count": 0, "retweet_count": 0}, "referenced_tweets": [{"id": "2120064894376558646", "type": "replied_to"}], "text": "@dotey 面试本来就不应该有通用的方法来应对，不然就变成了比谁准备得充分。理想情况就是大家都不准备，随便面什么都能直接回答。", "url": "https://x.com/ifnotthen/status/2120190533045985701"}, {"author_id": "2116016442164613120", "created_at": "2026-11-10T16:20:40.000Z", "edit_history_tweet_ids": ["2120189909432672526"], "id": "2120189909432672526", "in_reply_to_user_id": "3178231", "public_metrics": {"bookmark_count": 0, "impression_count": 4, "like_count": 0, "quote_count": 0, "reply_count": 0, "retweet_count": 0}, "referenced_tweets": [{"id": "2120064894376558646", "type": "replied_to"}], "text": "@dotey AI 面试最坑的是标准不透明，代码写对没用，还得猜面试官心里那条线在哪。以前刷题至少知道自己错在哪，现在被拒了都不知道是技术问题还是用法问题。", "url": "https://x.com/KrisMan17CP/status/2120189909432672526"}, {"author_id": "1216167367958355968", "created_at": "2026-11-10T16:15:42.000Z", "edit_history_tweet_ids": ["2120188660234805709"], "id": "2120188660234805709", "in_reply_to_user_id": "3178231", "public_metrics": {"bookmark_count": 0, "impression_count": 9, "like_count": 0, "quote_count": 0, "reply_count": 0, "retweet_count": 0}, "referenced_tweets": [{"id": "2120064894376558646", "type": "replied_to"}], "text": "@dotey 那段代码一眼就看出来", "url": "https://x.com/yzpq6668/status/2120188660234805709"}, {"author_id": "2096157714246479872", "created_at": "2026-11-10T16:14:06.000Z", "edit_history_tweet_ids": ["2120188258378269030"], "id": "2120188258378269030", "in_reply_to_user_id": "3178231", "public_metrics": {"bookmark_count": 0, "impression_count": 2, "like_count": 0, "quote_count": 0, "reply_count": 0, "retweet_count": 0}, "referenced_tweets": [{"id": "2120064894376558646", "type": "replied_to"}], "text": "@dotey Nobody mentions the obvious move: ask the interviewer to state the AI boundary out loud before you start. Half the room fails by guessing it wrong — and if they won't say, narrate each AI call as you make it, so the judgment is visible instead of guessed.", "url": "https://x.com/Zzxwlwf/status/2120188258378269030"}, {"author_id": "1796722170032435200", "created_at": "2026-11-10T16:05:03.000Z", "edit_history_tweet_ids": ["2120185978170003908"], "id": "2120185978170003908", "in_reply_to_user_id": "3178231", "public_metrics": {"bookmark_count": 0, "impression_count": 2, "like_count": 0, "quote_count": 0, "reply_count": 0, "retweet_count": 0}, "referenced_tweets": [{"id": "2120064894376558646", "type": "replied_to"}], "text": "@dotey AI coding interviews replace a clear test with a fuzzy one. The fair version should state upfront how much AI use is allowed and grade the review, debugging, and judgment, not just whether the code runs in 30 minutes.", "url": "https://x.com/Frank_brilliant/status/2120185978170003908"}, {"author_id": "1874666247356653568", "created_at": "2026-11-10T15:58:30.000Z", "edit_history_tweet_ids": ["2120184330916130888"], "id": "2120184330916130888", "in_reply_to_user_id": "3178231", "public_metrics": {"bookmar